      "value": "1-\n\nthe picture-series mode would prevent you taking 500 pics in 5min while holding on to the cam-gui so you actually CAN take a pic every 0.5s or so and deleting like 450 right after bc your hand does show in \"grabbing UI\" position\n\nusing the 5s timer multiple times/tries \"takes forever\", shoots a scuffed pic and needs you to hit it the 5s button again for another pretzel-pic\n\njust make it stick when enabled & maybe have a couple different timing-intervals... 0.5, 1.0, 3.0, 5.0s for example\n\ntypical example-pics",
