      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How about stream camera for people without VR headsets as well who want to use their PC to stream VRChat onto Twitch using OBS in a way that looks similar to being on a VR headset without issues. Controls can easily be based off of the Fly camera mode on VRChat without having too much issues. Also for many people using VRChat to get started on streaming (or vtubing) it would be great as then they could use it as a way to *try* to have a sub goal of say \"Get a VR Headset and FBT.\" that they can then later use (it's better than say not being able to start without having a VR Headset nor FBT on day 1 either. I think we all know of a lot of streamers who could benefit from this as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
