      "value": "Scratch #2 - thats off the list... but #1 still would be soooooo sweet! <3\n\nJust got informed the actual technical term for this function is \"TimeLapse-Mode\", so forget about \"Burst Shot\" again and go with \"TimeLapse\" :)\n\nAutomatically trigger a photo every 'user-selectable timeframe (~3-5 predefined values)' until manual stopping (or the storage-device is full [bursts])\n\nTLDR#2: So you dont have to cramp-grab the cam-UI while smashing the trigger every second just to end up with a scuffed \"hand in picture\"-pic. \n\nTrash/Keeper-Ratio: 75%|25%\n\nedit: attached a couple more \"cam-grab-cramp\" jank-piXx",
